  "description": "In-process event bus for AutoRegisterDependency. Publish/subscribe with auto-discovered handlers; supports IEventHandler<T>, IEventAsyncHandler<T> and result-returning variants. Handlers are matched by runtime type and implemented interfaces, and one failing handler does not stop the others. No third-party dependencies; not a durable message queue.",
